810
00:46:01,179 --> 00:46:04,679
イナ、イナ、イナ、気をつけて！
Ina, Ina, Ina, be careful!

811
00:46:05,679 --> 00:46:08,679
どれだけ美味しそうか話そうよ！
Let's talk about how delicious it looks!

812
00:46:08,679 --> 00:46:13,679
ほとんどイナより大きいね
It's almost bigger than Ina!

813
00:46:15,179 --> 00:46:17,179
ちょっと待って、今はダメ！
Hey, stop, stop, stop! Not now, not now!

814
00:46:17,179 --> 00:46:18,179
イチゴを取らないで！
Hey, don't take off the strawberries!

815
00:46:18,179 --> 00:46:21,179
落ち着いて。後でお祝いして食べよう。後で、後で。
Hold your horses. Let's eat it later and celebrate. Later, later.

816
00:46:21,679 --> 00:46:24,179
見て、トロフィーがあるよ！ / 本当だ！
And look, there's trophies! / Yeah, there are!

817
00:46:24,679 --> 00:46:27,679
授賞式ができるね？ / やろう！
We can do an award show, right? / Oh, let's do that!

818
00:46:28,179 --> 00:46:31,179
本当にトロフィーを用意してくれたの？
Did they actually get us trophies?

819
00:46:31,179 --> 00:46:33,679
うん、話を聞いてくれてたんだね。ありがとう！
Yeah! They were listening. Thank you!

820
00:46:34,179 --> 00:46:36,679
5年だもん、賞をもらう価値はあるよね
Five years, we deserve an award.

821
00:46:36,679 --> 00:46:41,179
有意義な成果がたくさんあるから、何があるか見てみよう！
We have so many meaningful accomplishments, so let's see what they all are, okay?

822
00:46:41,179 --> 00:46:43,179
オッケー！何だろう？
Okay! What'll it be?

823
00:46:43,679 --> 00:46:46,679
私から始めようか？私のもらうね。 / ハクション！
Shall I start? I'll take mine. / (sneezes) Achoo!

824
00:46:47,179 --> 00:46:49,179
お大事に！ / お大事にね。
Bless you! / Bless you.

825
00:46:50,179 --> 00:46:53,179
タララーン！ / ハクション！
Tada-da-da-da! / (sneezes) Achoo!

826
00:46:53,179 --> 00:46:57,179
お大事に！授賞式を邪魔するつもりはないんだよ。 / 何をもらったの？
Oh, bless you! We're not trying to disrupt your award ceremony. / What did you get?

827
00:46:58,179 --> 00:47:04,179
私の賞は…ええと、こう書いてあるかな…
Alright, my award is... let's see... I think it says...

828
00:47:04,179 --> 00:47:08,179
最多調理賞！
Most Meals Cooked Award!

829
00:47:08,179 --> 00:47:10,679
彼女は料理してる！ / ホロENでね！
She's cooking! / In HoloEN!

830
00:47:11,179 --> 00:47:14,179
料理させてあげて！ / たくさん料理してるもんね。
Let her cook! / She has been cooking a lot.

831
00:47:14,179 --> 00:47:18,179
たくさん作ってるよ。
She made a lot.

832
00:47:18,179 --> 00:47:23,179
ありがとう。主に健康的な生活を送って、
Yes, thank you. I think that's what that's about mostly, about, you know, me living a healthy lifestyle

833
00:47:23,179 --> 00:47:27,179
家でたくさん料理をしたことについてだね。
and then cooking many meals at home, yeah.

834
00:47:27,179 --> 00:47:29,679
いつかみんなにも料理を振る舞えたらいいな。
I wish I could cook for you girls someday.

835
00:47:30,179 --> 00:47:35,179
今日のパフォーマンスを楽しんでもらえたら嬉しいです。
I hope you guys enjoyed my performances today. I am so proud

836
00:47:35,179 --> 00:47:39,179
何年も経った今でも、同期と一緒にここに立てることを誇りに思います。
to stand here with my genmates, even on this day after so many years.

837
00:47:41,179 --> 00:47:46,179
もちろん、これからも努力し続けます。もっと賞をもらえるようにね。
Um, I will continue to work hard, of course, so that I can maybe gather even more awards.

838
00:47:49,179 --> 00:47:53,679
これは家の棚に飾るよ。猫たちが毛をいっぱいつけたり、
Um, I will put this on my shelf at home where my cats will also probably put a lot of fur on it,

839
00:47:54,179 --> 00:47:56,679
落としたりするだろうけど。 / 落としたりね。
or knock it down. / Or knock it down.

840
00:47:56,679 --> 00:47:59,179
やめてよ！ / 猫はそういうの好きだからね。 / 本物のガラス？
Oh, no, no, no! / They like to do that. / Is it out of real glass?

841
00:48:00,179 --> 00:48:02,679
結構重いね。 / 少し気をつけなきゃ。
It's kind of heavy. / I've got to be a little bit careful.

842
00:48:03,179 --> 00:48:08,179
みんな本当にありがとう！大好きだよ。これまで光栄でした。
Thank you guys so much! I love you girls. It's been an honor so far,

843
00:48:08,179 --> 00:48:11,179
これからも一緒に頑張ろうね。
so let's do our best together.

844
00:48:11,179 --> 00:48:14,679
この賞をありがとう！
Thank you for this award!

845
00:48:15,179 --> 00:48:18,179
次は誰？ / 次は誰？一伊那尓栖かな？
Who is next? / Who is next? Is it Ninomae Ina'nis?

846
00:48:19,179 --> 00:48:22,179
私？私の賞は…何だろう。
Me? Oh, could my award be... let's see.

847
00:48:23,179 --> 00:48:25,679
誰が暴力的？ / そう、誰が暴力的？
Who's violent? / Yeah, who's violent?

848
00:48:25,679 --> 00:48:29,679
何の暴力？ / 自業自得だよ。 / 違うよ！よし…
Violent what? / You do it to yourself. / No, no, no. All right...

849
00:48:30,179 --> 00:48:34,179
私の賞は…
My award is...

850
00:48:34,179 --> 00:48:38,179
おお、やっぱり… / もう予想してたよ！
Oh, yes... / I already guessed!

851
00:48:38,179 --> 00:48:41,179
「最も床で過ごした時間が多いで賞」！
"Most Time Spent on the Floor Award!"

852
00:48:41,179 --> 00:48:44,179
それは納得だね！ / おめでとう！
Oh, that I believe, yeah! / Yes! Congratulations!

853
00:48:44,679 --> 00:48:49,179
ありがとう、みんな。私がこの賞をもらうなんて思ってなかったかもしれないけど、
Thank you, thank you, thank you. I know you guys probably think I would never get this award, but, you know...

854
00:48:49,679 --> 00:48:52,679
床にいるために一生懸命頑張ったんだよ！ / 素晴らしいね。
I worked so hard to stay on the floor! / Very, very impressive.

855
00:48:53,179 --> 00:48:57,179
それに、床にいただけじゃなくて、
And, uh, yeah, not only did I stay on the floor, I, you know,

856
00:48:57,179 --> 00:49:02,179
今年はみんなとうまくパフォーマンスできるように、
really did my best to practice dancing and singing this year

857
00:49:02,179 --> 00:49:06,179
歌とダンスを本当に頑張って練習したんだ。
to perform well with you guys, and I hope that you guys see that as well.

858
00:49:06,179 --> 00:49:11,179
応援本当にありがとう。これからもこのメンバーで頑張るね。
Thank you so much for all your support. I'll continue to do my best with these girls.

859
00:49:11,179 --> 00:49:15,179
イェーイ！これからも頑張ろう！ありがとう、イナ！
Yeah, yeah, yeah! Let's keep doing it! Thank you, Ina!

860
00:49:15,679 --> 00:49:17,679
そして最後は…
And last, but not least...

861
00:49:17,679 --> 00:49:20,679
森さん！何だろう？
Mori, Mori! Oh, what could it be?

862
00:49:20,679 --> 00:49:24,179
クシャミ王。最多クシャミ賞。
Our sneezer. The most sneezer.

863
00:49:24,179 --> 00:49:29,179
5周年記念配信で最もクシャミをしたで賞。 / 祝福されてるね。
The most sneezes in the 5th anniversary showcase. / Most blessed.

864
00:49:29,179 --> 00:49:34,179
実は、私のトロフィーは…「最良の最悪運賞」！
Okay. Well, actually, my trophy is for... Best Worst Luck Award!

865
00:49:34,179 --> 00:49:39,179
特に課金要素のあるゲームにおいてね。
Especially in games where there are microtransactions.

866
00:49:39,179 --> 00:49:42,679
現実でもそれを見たことがあるよ。
Yeah, I mean, I've seen it happen in real life.

867
00:49:43,179 --> 00:49:45,179
リアルタイムでね！
Real life, real time!

868
00:49:46,179 --> 00:49:50,179
でも、サインカードを引くための執念と決意は…
But the dedication, the determination to pull a signed card or not...

869
00:49:50,679 --> 00:49:52,679
まだ諦めないよ！
I'm not gonna give up yet.

870
00:49:53,179 --> 00:49:56,679
すぐに幸せになれると思う…
Real quick, I'm gonna be very happy...

871
00:49:57,179 --> 00:50:00,179
このセリフがすごく好きなんだ、諦めないって…
I really like that line. I'm not gonna...

872
00:50:00,234 --> 00:50:01,434
give up, yeah, because, because

873
00:50:01,434 --> 00:50:05,134
I'd like to think that we're not gonna give up yet

874
00:50:05,134 --> 00:50:07,634
because there's still so much that I want to do,

875
00:50:07,634 --> 00:50:10,734
the three of us together,

876
00:50:10,734 --> 00:50:14,134
together, you know?

877
00:50:14,134 --> 00:50:18,134
And I didn't think that I would be here five years from the start with you guys.

878
00:50:18,134 --> 00:50:19,634
Same. / Same.

879
00:50:19,634 --> 00:50:22,234
I really thought I'd be out of here. / Same.

880
00:50:22,234 --> 00:50:27,734
But now, I can't... I can't see a future where I'm not here with you guys, so for now...

881
00:50:27,734 --> 00:50:30,634
Aww, so sweet!

882
00:50:30,634 --> 00:50:32,134
Shucks! / Okay.

883
00:50:32,134 --> 00:50:37,534
So because of that, I'm not gonna give up... I don't want to give up yet. So let's do our best!

884
00:50:37,534 --> 00:50:39,334
Do our best! Do our best! Do our best!

885
00:50:39,334 --> 00:50:41,734
Oh yeah, the wrap-up music is playing!

886
00:50:41,734 --> 00:50:45,234
The wrap-up music is playing! I'm just gonna start talking about nothing

887
00:50:45,234 --> 00:50:48,534
because that annoys me when they play the jingle that tells us to go. This morning I ate a bagel...

888
00:50:48,534 --> 00:50:51,534
and it had cream cheese on it. It was delicious, but it went all over my face

889
00:50:51,534 --> 00:50:54,634
and I got into big, big trouble with my trainer. / You're a rapper, you should wrap!

890
00:50:54,634 --> 00:50:57,334
Anyway, you can't get rid of me!

891
00:50:57,334 --> 00:50:59,434
You can't get rid of...

892
00:50:59,434 --> 00:51:01,334
...any of us, hopefully! / Any of us.

893
00:51:01,334 --> 00:51:05,134
All right, everybody. All good things come to an end, unfortunately.

894
00:51:05,134 --> 00:51:10,934
But thank you so much to the Hololive community for supporting us continuously for five years.

895
00:51:10,934 --> 00:51:14,534
Thank you to the girlies today and all the staff-san that supported us also

896
00:51:14,534 --> 00:51:17,534
for the celebration, who gave us the trophies. / Yeah.

897
00:51:17,534 --> 00:51:19,634
Once again, congratulations to us! To us!

898
00:51:19,634 --> 00:51:21,634
Yay!

899
00:51:21,634 --> 00:51:23,334
Oh, five years! Oh yeah!

900
00:51:23,334 --> 00:51:24,634
Thank you!

901
00:51:24,634 --> 00:51:26,034
Thanks, guys!

902
00:51:26,034 --> 00:51:28,334
Bye-bye! Bye-bye! Bye-bye!

903
00:51:28,334 --> 00:51:30,634
Peace.

904
00:51:30,634 --> 00:51:34,434
Next is the merch! / Merch! Merch, please! Merch is next!

905
00:51:34,434 --> 00:51:38,434
The merchant-eyes! / The merchandise!

906
00:51:38,434 --> 00:51:43,034
Next is the merchandise announcement!

907
00:51:43,034 --> 00:51:50,034
We have Hololive English -Myth- 5th Anniversary Celebration merch being released!

908
00:51:50,034 --> 00:51:52,034
Let's look at the details. Check it out!

909
00:51:52,034 --> 00:51:56,434
First up, we've got the Mirror Acrylic Panel.

910
00:51:56,434 --> 00:52:01,534
It's designed so that the surroundings and background of the illustration have a metallic, mirrored vibe.

911
00:52:01,534 --> 00:52:06,134
Ooh, so cool! I absolutely love this illustration. Hope you guys do too!

912
00:52:06,134 --> 00:52:10,434
Next up, we have the Collection Cards.

913
00:52:10,434 --> 00:52:15,034
These cards feature a shiny metallic finish...

914
00:52:15,034 --> 00:52:18,334
...and you can choose from three different designs.

915
00:52:18,334 --> 00:52:21,434
Also, the backside is matching for us all.

916
00:52:21,434 --> 00:52:24,934
Make sure to get the one from your oshi, for sure!

917
00:52:24,934 --> 00:52:27,934
Next up, we have the Coin Medals!

918
00:52:27,934 --> 00:52:32,234
Our shiny 5th Anniversary commemorative Coin Medals.

919
00:52:32,234 --> 00:52:35,134
There's one design for each member...

920
00:52:35,134 --> 00:52:37,634
...and the backside also has a common design.

921
00:52:37,634 --> 00:52:41,134
They come in an antique gold-plated finish inside...

922
00:52:41,134 --> 00:52:45,534
...the original packaging. Ooh, so shiny!

923
00:52:45,534 --> 00:52:51,534
Oh man, everything looks so good! But I'm especially interested in what we have to show you guys next.

924
00:52:51,534 --> 00:52:55,034
Next up, we have the Anniversary Hats!

925
00:52:55,034 --> 00:52:58,934
So first up, Anniversary Hat - Mori Calliope.

926
00:52:58,934 --> 00:53:02,034
This one uses a soft, fluffy fabric.

927
00:53:02,034 --> 00:53:06,134
The Death Sensei part is removable, so you can also rock it without him.

928
00:53:06,134 --> 00:53:09,334
Make sure that you check it out. It's super stylish!

929
00:53:09,334 --> 00:53:11,934
I love the shape so much, and...

930
00:53:11,934 --> 00:53:15,734
...all of my member Dead Beats voted on it together, so hope that you guys will enjoy.

931
00:53:15,734 --> 00:53:20,334
Next up, we have mine, the Anniversary Hat from Takanashi Kiara!

932
00:53:20,334 --> 00:53:22,034
It looks like this.

933
00:53:22,034 --> 00:53:24,634
The decorative parts are removable.

934
00:53:24,634 --> 00:53:29,534
It can be worn reversibly, inside out, so you'll have a different color then.

935
00:53:29,534 --> 00:53:33,434
And it's a bucket hat style design, which we didn't have before for me.

936
00:53:33,434 --> 00:53:36,334
Very fashionable, I must say!

937
00:53:36,334 --> 00:53:41,234
Last but not least, we have my hat, the Anniversary Hat - Ninomae Ina'nis!

938
00:53:41,234 --> 00:53:45,534
The ribbon part is removable, and the patches are super cute too!

939
00:53:45,534 --> 00:53:48,234
You can wear it to become Takodachi. Yes.

940
00:53:48,234 --> 00:53:52,434
And yeah, you can mix and match with or without the ribbon for different looks.

941
00:53:52,434 --> 00:53:56,134
So everybody, be sure to check our merch out!

942
00:53:56,134 --> 00:54:00,334
And that concludes our 5th Year Anniversary stream!

943
00:54:00,334 --> 00:54:04,234
Ultimate Myth!

944
00:54:09,834 --> 00:54:12,534
I'm not gonna give up yet,

945
00:54:12,534 --> 00:54:15,734
I spin back 'round with every chance I get,

946
00:54:15,734 --> 00:54:18,734
The wheel turns and the die is cast,

947
00:54:18,734 --> 00:54:22,034
The time has come for fate to change at last.

948
00:54:22,034 --> 00:54:24,934
And if it's black or red, I'm moving up ahead!

949
00:54:24,934 --> 00:54:27,934
A perfect chance, a daring dance

950
00:54:27,934 --> 00:54:31,734
I'll spin this thread of fate with my own hands

951
00:54:31,734 --> 00:54:34,734
Ooh la la la

952
00:54:34,734 --> 00:54:37,534
I'm taking fate into my hands

953
00:54:37,534 --> 00:54:40,234
Whoah, yeah

954
00:54:40,234 --> 00:54:44,434
And through this tangled thread, I see what's up ahead

955
00:54:44,434 --> 00:54:49,234
And through this tangled thread, I see what's up ahead

